  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Crafted in Saffiano leather with a magnetic flap, interior slip pocket, and adjustable strap, our small crossbody moves from the commute to dinner without a costume change—part of our On Purpose collection, which is made by a group of 200+ talented artisans from Abahizi Rwanda. An employee-owned and B Corp certified supplier, Abahizi empowers the women who work there through full-time employment, mental-health and well-being support, and healthcare for each employee and her family.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Saffiano Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot; from center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior Back Slip Pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Flap Closure with Magnetic Snap</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.52&quot; (L) x 5.84&quot; (H) x 2.00&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
